  "details": "Only noticed in the Pride event, the list of the instance is limited at 12 at max(16 on the website), while showing instances you can't join, age instances maybe, but half of the list being closed instances is another thing. I also found inconsistences to the list when I doing refreshes. Also every time I click one of the instance the very instance will jump around in the list for somehow.\n\nIt is possible to join from the website, but the website provides zero information about the instance(no consents if you have no information). And it's possible to check via group page, unless you are doing cross-group/pure-public events(with world gimmicks, like Vket). Since this will clear cause issues for people/corps to do BIG multiple instances/groups events, I think it's something should be addressed, which the best way is to show the whole list(better with filter/sort options btw)",
